IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CHUNKED-KV-ALLOC.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOTAL-TOKENS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 CHUNK-SIZE          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 NUM-CHUNKS          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 FRAG-PCT            PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CHUNKED-KV.
    IF CHUNK-SIZE == 0
        MOVE 32 TO CHUNK-SIZE.
    END-IF.

    # num_chunks = (TOTAL-TOKENS + CHUNK-SIZE - 1) / CHUNK-SIZE
    MOVE TOTAL-TOKENS TO R14.
    ADD CHUNK-SIZE TO R14.
    SUBTRACT 1 FROM R14.
    DIVIDE CHUNK-SIZE INTO R14.
    MOVE R14 TO NUM-CHUNKS.
    IF NUM-CHUNKS == 0
        MOVE 1 TO NUM-CHUNKS.
    END-IF.

    # allocated = num_chunks * chunk_size
    # wasted = allocated - total_tokens
    # frag_pct = (wasted * 100) / allocated
    MOVE NUM-CHUNKS TO R14.
    MULTIPLY CHUNK-SIZE BY R14.
    MOVE R14 TO R13.
    SUBTRACT TOTAL-TOKENS FROM R13.
    MULTIPLY 100 BY R13.
    DIVIDE R14 INTO R13.
    MOVE R13 TO FRAG-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-CHUNKS.
    WEIGHT 30 FRAG-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
